WEBVTT

00:04.550 --> 00:05.570
They're finally here!

00:05.570 --> 00:07.510
It's Senku-chan and the others!

00:07.510 --> 00:09.420
We can finally get out of here!

00:10.370 --> 00:12.400
We're going straight for the enemy's heart!

00:12.750 --> 00:14.070
But why?!

00:14.070 --> 00:17.200
We're going on a rampage to shut down Ibara.

00:17.200 --> 00:19.860
We gotta get it done before

00:19.860 --> 00:23.540
Taiju and Yuzuriha's team shows 
up with the master's statue.

00:24.810 --> 00:27.190
But there are only nine of us!

00:27.190 --> 00:29.710
Do you know how many hundreds 
of the enemy there are?!

00:29.710 --> 00:31.010
This isn't gonna work!

00:35.290 --> 00:37.850
And we're already getting started!

02:27.410 --> 02:32.880
After all that waxing lyrical about 
how serious an invention the gun is,

02:32.880 --> 02:36.670
and about how we're still going 
to stick to not killing anyone...

02:36.670 --> 02:39.880
Die, Ibara!

02:45.790 --> 02:47.440
The ship's getting messed up!

02:47.440 --> 02:49.480
Just how many sorcery users are there?!

02:50.480 --> 02:54.030
He's so brutish that 
everything else seems so stupid.

02:54.030 --> 02:57.110
It's a strength only Magma-chan can ever have.

02:58.920 --> 03:01.320
I'mma kill you all!

03:00.140 --> 03:01.950
How about you die?!

03:03.770 --> 03:05.100
Enough with the hitting!

03:05.100 --> 03:06.270
I'll beat you to death!

03:07.020 --> 03:08.350
You amuse me.

03:08.350 --> 03:10.230
Bring it on, Magma.

03:10.230 --> 03:12.040
Try me if you dare!

03:12.280 --> 03:15.290
Thank goodness for Nikki!

03:24.550 --> 03:25.890
Don't waste ammo!

03:25.890 --> 03:27.110
He's right.

03:27.110 --> 03:29.640
It's our secret weapon.

03:29.640 --> 03:30.890
Damn it!

03:30.890 --> 03:32.910
I only have three more shots!

03:32.910 --> 03:33.780
Damn.

03:34.950 --> 03:37.440
Hey, Senku, what's that?

03:37.750 --> 03:39.690
Magnesium.

03:39.690 --> 03:42.580
Quick-and-dirty fireworks.

03:42.900 --> 03:43.910
There.

03:49.870 --> 03:51.210
What is that?!

03:53.110 --> 03:54.530
Sorcery!

03:54.530 --> 03:56.380
Spear of Light!

03:58.210 --> 04:03.930
All fifty sorcery users on the 
ship are gonna go pew-pew!

04:08.620 --> 04:09.710
Yeah!

04:09.710 --> 04:11.670
His bullshit worked!

04:12.520 --> 04:14.960
Well, the gun itself isn't bullshit at all.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.520
It's a legit gun.

04:17.450 --> 04:18.570
What's going on?

04:18.570 --> 04:20.820
There's a boat coming our way.

04:28.380 --> 04:30.420
You're here too early.

04:30.420 --> 04:33.230
There's no escaping or negotiating this time.

04:33.230 --> 04:36.010
We're in for a head-on battle 
with the enemy's main force.

04:38.170 --> 04:39.840
We're counting on you, Sheriff!

04:42.820 --> 04:46.970
Sorcery users always manipulate something 
with their fingers for a moment.

04:53.240 --> 04:55.450
I saw your finger there!

04:56.020 --> 04:58.690
You're the sorcery user, aren't you?

05:06.070 --> 05:07.480
The gun!

05:07.480 --> 05:09.070
Now we're done for!

05:39.030 --> 05:41.240
Anything, Senku-chan?

05:41.560 --> 05:44.820
Are you all out of science tricks?

05:44.820 --> 05:46.950
Yeah, I've got nothing.

05:46.950 --> 05:48.570
Fresh out of tricks.

06:09.570 --> 06:12.640
Shit, there's nowhere to run!

06:12.640 --> 06:15.080
We've been cornered!

06:21.710 --> 06:23.250
Too bad.

06:29.170 --> 06:33.440
Well, well, newcomers!

06:34.180 --> 06:36.300
You did the best you could, didn't you?

06:36.300 --> 06:40.000
I'm so moved!

06:40.250 --> 06:41.890
However...

06:41.890 --> 06:45.500
It's time to put an end to this.

06:47.890 --> 06:50.060
We weren't cornered.

06:50.060 --> 06:52.470
We had you corner us.

06:52.690 --> 06:55.140
In this particular room.

06:55.140 --> 06:56.100
Huh?

07:00.490 --> 07:02.390
Isn't this storage room...

07:03.620 --> 07:06.400
I didn't want to use this card.

07:08.440 --> 07:10.690
It's the joker.

07:12.810 --> 07:14.190
<i>I see.</i>

07:14.190 --> 07:20.080
<i>Ibara-chan's guys couldn't get through 
the metal door of science.</i>

07:20.440 --> 07:21.770
I understand.

07:22.310 --> 07:24.210
There's no other way.

07:41.610 --> 07:45.150
We've gone and freed him.

07:49.650 --> 07:50.570
Hyoga!

07:52.810 --> 07:55.890
I'm handing this golden spear to you.

08:02.390 --> 08:04.010
We don't have our gun anymore.

08:04.010 --> 08:06.630
How are we going to stop him later?

08:07.130 --> 08:11.060
We learned the hard way how 
insanely strong Hyoga is!

08:13.120 --> 08:15.660
That's something we can worry about later.

08:15.660 --> 08:20.180
We don't even know if the great 
Hyoga-sensei will be on our side.

08:20.180 --> 08:26.440
The forbidden joker card is the only way 
to go against someone as powerful as Moz.

08:26.900 --> 08:33.940
<i>That thin-eyed kid they called Hyoga 
was definitely a statue just now.</i>

08:33.940 --> 08:38.700
<i>And... that guy in the hat over there...</i>

08:46.850 --> 08:49.170
Where do you think you're going, Ibara?!

08:55.950 --> 09:00.600
I can tell from that one swing that 
you're clearly on another level.

09:01.830 --> 09:03.570
Moz-kun, was it?

09:03.570 --> 09:06.700
He's the reason you woke me up, correct?

09:06.700 --> 09:09.970
Yeah, I'm sure you've figured it out.

09:11.110 --> 09:13.730
I am your enemy, remember?

09:13.730 --> 09:15.780
Sure, you're supposed to be.

09:16.270 --> 09:18.970
Which means I could either 
join forces with you,

09:18.970 --> 09:21.570
and we can reign over the 
Kingdom of Science together...

09:21.910 --> 09:26.050
or I could join Moz-kun's side and 
kill all of the Kingdom of Science.

09:26.050 --> 09:27.290
I get to decide.

09:27.970 --> 09:33.290
I have the casting vote, do I not?

09:36.320 --> 09:41.850
<i>Those sorcery users can bring 
back even broken statues!</i>

09:43.900 --> 09:45.580
<i>This is bad!</i>

09:45.580 --> 09:47.640
<i>What if they revive </i>him<i>?</i>

09:53.000 --> 09:56.990
<i>The Master's statue that 
I left crumbled is a risk.</i>

10:05.540 --> 10:09.850
<i>We need to get Hyoga-chan to 
go up against Moz-chan somehow!</i>

10:09.850 --> 10:13.400
<i>Is there any way to make that happen?</i>

10:13.400 --> 10:16.090
<i>Think hard, mentalist Gen!</i>

10:16.310 --> 10:21.530
<i>Maybe if I can convince Moz-chan 
that Hyoga-chan's on our side,</i>

10:21.530 --> 10:24.410
<i>he'll have no choice but to fight.</i>

10:28.110 --> 10:32.180
Nikki-chan, could you pretend 
you're in love with Hyoga-chan?

10:33.150 --> 10:34.860
Me?!

10:34.860 --> 10:36.010
Are you dreaming?

10:36.010 --> 10:38.930
Amaryllis is the one who's 
good at those tricks! Not me!

10:38.930 --> 10:41.310
I mean, you're the only girl here.

10:41.310 --> 10:44.690
You can be totally awkward like Kohaku-chan.

10:44.690 --> 10:48.970
Just be all, "Love love!" 
and "I love you!" and stuff.

10:44.850 --> 10:46.600
<b>Love Love</b>

10:44.850 --> 10:46.600
<b>Love Love</b>

10:46.720 --> 10:48.730
<b>I love you</b>

10:46.720 --> 10:48.730
<b>I love you</b>

10:50.720 --> 10:54.090
Fine, if you insist!

10:54.090 --> 11:03.180
I will, but... like... I have to save 
those words for the one I really love.

11:03.180 --> 11:05.560
Isn't it, you know, important?

11:06.090 --> 11:07.400
<i>I forgot!</i>

11:07.400 --> 11:09.600
<i>She's the biggest romantic here!</i>

11:11.560 --> 11:15.000
Shut that filthy mouth of yours, Gen-kun.

11:16.660 --> 11:18.290
I will! I'll keep it shut!

11:16.660 --> 11:20.450
Squirm, squirm...

11:18.290 --> 11:20.450
Please don't kill me!

11:20.780 --> 11:22.510
I won't kill you.

11:22.510 --> 11:26.450
I think highly of your filthiness.

11:26.940 --> 11:30.260
You do your work very properly.

11:30.960 --> 11:33.240
Nikki-kun, so do you.

11:34.090 --> 11:38.720
You were quick to respond, despite it 
being a most difficult task for you.

11:39.790 --> 11:42.470
You are proper indeed.

11:43.500 --> 11:47.050
If I were to ally myself with Moz-kun,

11:47.050 --> 11:50.060
I would have to kill almost 
everyone here behind me.

11:51.190 --> 11:58.430
If only it weren't for your shallow-minded 
ambition to save all of humanity, Senku-kun.

11:59.770 --> 12:01.060
Quite simply...

12:02.360 --> 12:04.870
I desire selection.

12:06.450 --> 12:12.220
To have the foolish continue sleeping, 
leaving only superior genes.

12:12.880 --> 12:16.670
That is the way by which we become the apex.

12:17.660 --> 12:21.420
Moz-kun, what are your thoughts?

12:22.230 --> 12:23.860
<i>Is he evaluating us?</i>

12:24.370 --> 12:26.700
<i>To decide which of us to join?</i>

12:28.770 --> 12:30.720
I agree.

12:30.720 --> 12:33.380
Hyoga, was it?

12:33.380 --> 12:35.350
You're correct.

12:35.900 --> 12:37.760
There ought to be a selection.

12:38.650 --> 12:42.990
<i>I don't know how strong 
this thin-eyed kid is...</i>

12:43.310 --> 12:45.990
<i>but that's the answer he wants, isn't it?</i>

12:46.620 --> 12:51.580
In fact, we already have a 
selection on this island.

12:51.580 --> 12:54.960
We choose just the cute girls.

12:55.290 --> 12:59.040
You can have your own harem, too.

12:59.600 --> 13:02.420
<i>Of course, I'll kill you anyway.</i>

13:04.700 --> 13:07.180
You're a child, Moz!

13:07.540 --> 13:09.960
All women are beautiful.

13:09.960 --> 13:12.330
To think you wouldn't know such joy...

13:13.050 --> 13:15.690
I want every woman in the world!

13:16.940 --> 13:18.690
All beautiful?

13:19.240 --> 13:23.960
<i>What Ryusui-chan says is crazy 
enough in its own way, though.</i>

13:34.780 --> 13:40.050
Moz-kun, is your condition 
for superiority simply

13:40.050 --> 13:42.360
how beautiful a man or woman is?

13:42.980 --> 13:47.160
Of course. For women, at least.

13:47.160 --> 13:49.300
I'm a man, after all.

13:50.090 --> 13:51.670
I see.

13:53.130 --> 13:58.130
I never cared whose side I took to begin with.

13:58.600 --> 14:00.490
It doesn't concern me.

14:03.090 --> 14:04.990
I've made up my mind.

14:08.970 --> 14:10.240
It's done!

14:15.380 --> 14:16.370
Dad...

14:18.520 --> 14:21.630
I'm sorry I abandoned you 
for the past twenty years.

14:22.570 --> 14:25.710
I'll introduce you to the people 
from the island in a moment.

14:27.210 --> 14:28.750
What's this?

14:30.420 --> 14:32.260
Kirisame-chan!

14:32.710 --> 14:36.730
Fantastic! Great timing!

14:40.760 --> 14:42.110
Senku-kun, stand aside.

14:42.110 --> 14:42.970
Yeah.

14:50.020 --> 14:52.350
He can fight better without us here.

14:52.350 --> 14:53.360
Let's go!

14:57.130 --> 15:00.080
We're coming, everyone!

15:02.610 --> 15:03.640
See?

15:03.640 --> 15:08.020
My allies are all very proper indeed.

15:11.840 --> 15:13.040
Move, move, move!

15:13.040 --> 15:16.350
Sorcery users coming through!

15:23.780 --> 15:29.010
Are you brushing me aside just to 
go after Senku-kun and his friends?

15:29.410 --> 15:32.000
You can't win like that, Moz-kun.

15:32.680 --> 15:34.610
You need to do this properly.

15:46.890 --> 15:48.550
We're going back to the island?

15:48.550 --> 15:49.450
Yeah.

15:49.450 --> 15:51.950
Dude, that's a bad idea!

15:51.950 --> 15:55.210
This whole island's going to get petrified!

15:55.210 --> 15:56.600
Why are we going?

15:56.860 --> 16:00.230
I was just talking out of 
my ass to throw Moz off.

16:00.650 --> 16:04.070
Hyoga can't fight with us in the way?

16:04.070 --> 16:06.690
Since when was I so kind?

16:07.000 --> 16:08.570
True!

16:09.690 --> 16:11.700
Everyone agreed all at once.

16:12.110 --> 16:16.850
The truth is, there's something 
we need to pick up on the island.

16:16.850 --> 16:20.790
Once we make that, we win.

16:26.940 --> 16:28.610
All right, Hyoga.

16:29.210 --> 16:32.510
Why don't I do this properly 
so that you'll be satisfied?

16:33.850 --> 16:35.660
I'll focus on you.

16:35.660 --> 16:38.040
You're certainly strong.

16:38.510 --> 16:42.970
<i>He's finally coming full-force.</i>

16:44.250 --> 16:45.790
So sorry.

16:46.340 --> 16:50.650
Did I make you think you stood a chance?

17:12.990 --> 17:15.770
Oarashi-chan!

17:17.670 --> 17:23.270
Would you mind taking this decoration 
and running to the middle of the island?

17:25.100 --> 17:27.850
Ibara-sama, do you mean to 
petrify the entire island?

17:31.340 --> 17:34.950
But if he's to activate the petrification 
device in the middle of the island,

17:34.950 --> 17:38.110
how is Oarashi himself to escape?

17:38.880 --> 17:42.620
Why would I care?

17:43.200 --> 17:49.520
Actually, those sorcery users have 
medicine to undo petrification.

17:49.520 --> 17:52.360
But I need to be safe, right?

17:52.360 --> 17:55.430
So I'll have you continue to be by my side,

17:55.430 --> 17:59.430
and have Oarashi do it. 
It doesn't matter if he dies. Right?

17:59.770 --> 18:01.980
It does matter if he dies!

18:01.980 --> 18:04.680
Besides, the islanders haven't evacuated yet!

18:05.620 --> 18:10.690
You dare oppose the Master's wishes?

18:11.610 --> 18:13.360
The Master?

18:15.190 --> 18:16.830
Master!

18:17.450 --> 18:18.450
Master!

18:18.450 --> 18:20.700
Please turn the mountain to stone!

18:20.700 --> 18:22.700
The whole thing! Bam!

18:23.210 --> 18:26.290
Oh? But why?

18:26.630 --> 18:28.510
We heard there's a monster.

18:28.510 --> 18:30.330
We're scared.

18:41.670 --> 18:43.060
A scarecrow.

18:43.590 --> 18:47.450
Someone must have thrown 
this old scarecrow away.

18:47.450 --> 18:49.450
Whew!

18:50.470 --> 18:52.400
Listen up, everyone.

18:52.800 --> 18:57.630
The petrification light must 
never be used in a broad area.

19:00.660 --> 19:05.990
This world doesn't exist 
merely to serve humans.

19:06.800 --> 19:10.500
It belongs to all that live.

19:11.550 --> 19:14.580
Don't forget that.

19:16.480 --> 19:19.190
Petrifying the whole island 
would be unheard of.

19:19.670 --> 19:22.560
It's most certainly an act of abuse.

19:23.470 --> 19:29.140
Ibara-sama, is that truly the Master's wish?

19:34.870 --> 19:38.030
Check it out, everyone!

19:38.030 --> 19:39.860
It's the Master!

19:39.860 --> 19:42.630
The Master's here!

19:42.630 --> 19:47.290
The Master is a statue!

19:47.290 --> 19:48.350
Look!

19:47.940 --> 19:51.420
Everyone can hear him now.

19:48.350 --> 19:52.110
This statue! It's the Master!

19:51.660 --> 19:53.120
How mighty...

19:52.110 --> 19:56.880
The Master is a statue!

19:53.670 --> 19:55.890
They might not believe him, though.

19:55.890 --> 19:58.020
We have to show them up close.

19:56.880 --> 19:59.260
Look at him!

19:59.260 --> 20:01.020
The Master...

19:59.260 --> 20:03.880
The Master is a statue!

20:01.930 --> 20:04.720
Ibara-sama, what is going on?

20:03.880 --> 20:07.770
Look! This is the Master!

20:06.670 --> 20:08.850
One meter.

20:08.850 --> 20:11.100
One second!

20:25.270 --> 20:26.450
Ibara-sa—

20:28.160 --> 20:29.220
No...

20:29.730 --> 20:32.850
Ibara! You bastard!

20:40.960 --> 20:43.160
Bye-bye!

20:43.160 --> 20:48.080
Thank you for your servitude, Kirisame-chan.

20:48.080 --> 20:50.190
What a shame!

20:50.190 --> 20:52.090
What could I do, though?

20:52.090 --> 20:54.530
You're guilty of knowing.

21:02.580 --> 21:04.070
Petrification beam!

21:04.070 --> 21:05.970
Let's go! As far as we can!

21:07.760 --> 21:13.770
Now I just need to use this to petrify 
those guys, and bam, it's over.

21:20.310 --> 21:21.760
What was that noise?

21:23.970 --> 21:25.430
What...

21:26.560 --> 21:29.800
Ibara, you have the right to remain silent!

21:34.800 --> 21:37.370
I've always wanted to say that.

21:37.950 --> 21:40.960
<i>I shot one of the remaining bullets 
in the air and the other at Moz.</i>

21:40.960 --> 21:43.400
<i>Which means the last one...</i>

21:44.290 --> 21:46.730
Anything you say can be 
used against you in...

21:46.730 --> 21:48.120
What comes after that again?

21:48.120 --> 21:50.800
Battery? Obstruction of something-something?

21:50.800 --> 21:53.450
I dunno. Whatever.

21:53.450 --> 21:56.750
You're under arrest on suspicion of being bad!

22:09.230 --> 22:13.520
The Medusa's mine!

23:49.440 --> 23:52.530
Flicker of Doom

23:51.970 --> 23:54.950
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:51.990 --> 23:54.950
<b>Flicker of Doom</b>

23:54.950 --> 23:59.950
<b>This is a work of fiction, but the plants, 
animals, and production methods described are based on reality.
Foraging and making things on your own accord is extremely dangerous
and, in some cases, illegal. Please do not imitate without expertise.</b>
